ney to an adventurer of your class.","source_tag":"_t","target":"好极了。哦，对了，差点忘了：要使用水晶球，你得支付150金币的标准费用。\n对你这样的冒险家来说，这肯定不过是九牛一毛。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7e3956030a9bab87a3e216addfeb9bfae1c70e3744a4a34b63bcc089e896ac02","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"74867bb13ad36ff8b75b912839f8aa789dd69147e536f596e70020eed0816890","logical_entry_identity":"2b52396e88df169e9c142e88d7c670dc6205da2ba0b1b934aef306c3865a95df","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Learn how to coat your melee weapons, throwing knives, sling and bow ammo with poison, giving your attacks a %d%% chance to poison the target for %d nature damage per turn for %d turns. Every application of the poison stacks, up to a maximum of %d nature damage per turn.\n\t\tThe damage scales with your Cunning.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"学会如何在近战武器、飞刀、弹药上涂毒，命中后有 %d%% 几率使目标中毒，每回合受到 %d 自然伤害，持续 %d 回合。毒素效果可以叠加至 %d 伤害每回合。\n\t\t伤害受灵巧加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0107fbd8478cc31f5153ecd8e23c2ed44447f30b823c6a05aaa755fb5a7316f2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7495c425ba77473b2c302bc6a8852b96f5cb621819141de4b275fdb66156461d","logical_entry_identity":"e6ef7a0cd88717f96d16d07b8f11a3301259e5556a1b723a31d900894c739f9a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I'VE RETURNED WITH THE INGREDIENTS FOR THE %s.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"我回来了，我找到了%s的材料。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d5ba440ce869870eb64d6173d8cc58ba7edb05e6c112429e8cab4b1460beeb3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"749dcc547e498dcfdf040e47e323d2a1e821c3aaa9c0ec2397dea2fa0d5f0b41","logical_entry_identity":"923ab70ae3bd75e55b8ed6b24c4097c63b142528d226a08e79979c59a49e477f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Assault your target with all weapons, dealing two strikes with your telekinetically-wielded weapon for %d%% damage followed by an attack with your physical weapon for %d%% damage.\n\t\tThis physical weapon attack uses your Willpower and Cunning instead of Strength and Dexterity to determine Accuracy and damage.\n\t\tAny active Aura damage bonusses will extend to your main weapons for this attack.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用你的所有武器打击目标，使用你的灵能武器打击两次，造成 %d%% 伤害，然后使用你的物理武器打击一次，造成 %d%% 伤害。\n\t\t物理武器将会使用意志值和灵巧值代替力量值和敏捷值决定命中和伤害。\n\t\t在这次攻击中，所有启用的光环伤害加成效果也会适用到你的主武器上。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ae600c48af0209fbad04f221164576d2bfb41e5639974dcbf733a4a485430ae2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"74a0cbbc178e07c0ecd5584458f7bca1d826c28f72601b3748193d796ed710ba","logical_entry_identity":"8bd925746df71e7f8e90b71f3d4b6d5695bf369ecc7fb69374613346c1edf884","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s reflects the spell!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s反射了法术！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"07832eb3dc016616a9d90f3d23ba648f10413a22e71d5a0c6627a8d623d665ae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"74a4038c24e56cc890a1a05cbc3120b64be58eff4df920931aeb675e26cbb5b1","logical_entry_identity":"7ea5973a1737d58cb587b9852160e27dd87b44673e60d54aebb54ba4a9557703","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Go %s! We will hold the line!","source_tag":"tformat","target":"去吧%s!我们会坚守防线！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c13db5f8cb1e11bb3f3333cf9369fc7d11b39d5900736cc7516e9dacbfd69a08","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"74a5ebae2de7cbda2858d13482449d3d7859fccd05d00aa781f0359a0d4bc8c7","logical_entry_identity":"431d5f258b50f27f33067bd872e1eafd99b940eb0235b1b15eaf4fa9f8febad7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s's %s shakes the ground with its impact!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s的%s震动了大地！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c5d92842923f1b954c7c63fc99293341bfdb684cf3ecd154b85227b3585a4adb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"74a6ab557af5a5b955133dd4ab107bc041332d17ede27fa010d62057b092ffcb","logical_entry_identity":"097ae7b4b0f26ff12fa8b55b0f76c76ba94ccdebb7d70d806aba20a00ca1906d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s shakes off the fear!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s 豁免了恐惧！"}],"fixed_s